# AIControlCenter — Cursor Rules

## Before every task
- Read /docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
- Read /docs/DATA_AND_BUSINESS_LOGIC.md
- Read /docs/UI_UX_GUIDELINES.md
- Read /docs/TASKS.md

## Code rules
- TypeScript strict mode only — no `any`
- Never calculate metrics inside components
- Never pass raw logs to Claude API
- Always use buildDashboardContext() before AI calls
- Never hardcode colors — Tailwind semantic classes only
- No component over 150 lines — split if needed
- Business logic only in /lib/analytics.ts

## File structure rules
- Pages in /app/
- Components in /components/
- Business logic in /lib/
- Data files in /data/
- API routes in /app/api/

## AI routes rules
- Model: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
- Max output tokens: 500 for /api/query, 1500 for /api/analyze
- Structured JSON output only from /api/analyze
- Validate JSON before returning from any AI route

## Stack
- Next.js 15 App Router
- TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Recharts
- i18next for all user-facing strings
- next-themes for dark/light